    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A rare opportunity to acquire an attractive spacious detached home set on approximately 0.77 acres, surrounded by mature trees\r\n\r\nHas the benefit of views of Nephin Mountain and Lough Conn to the rear.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys a peaceful rural setting while remaining within easy reach of local amenities\r\n Ideally located just 4 miles from Ballina town and approximately 3 miles from Knockmore village to include shop, Knockmore/Rathduff centre with Gym, Bars, GAA football pitch, with Soccer pitch a short drive away.\r\n\r\n Castlebar is approximately 19 miles away, while Ireland West Airport Knock is approximately 25 miles from the property. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises: Entrance porch, hall, 3 bedrooms, including two ensuite bedrooms; Bathroom, w.c, Utility room; Sitting room; Kitchen/dining/living room.\r\n Large Garage with ample storage & spacious parking area.\r\n\r\n The residence is beautifully enclosed by mature hedging and established trees, providing an exceptional level of privacy while still allowing you to enjoy the magnificent views towards the lake and surrounding countryside. \r\n\r\nThis exceptional property offers considerable potential, whether as a private family residence, investment property or holiday home. \r\nThe generous site, peaceful surroundings and stunning natural setting make this a particularly appealing opportunity. \r\nA short distance from Cloghans NS & Rathduff Church is just a short walk away, while The Lodge Bar, a character-filled traditional pub renowned locally is only a short drive from the property. \r\n\r\nFor fishing enthusiasts, Lough Conn is on your doorstep, offering an outstanding opportunity to enjoy one of the area's renowned natural amenities right on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nProperties combining this level of space, privacy and spectacular scenery are rarely available. \r\nInspection is highly recommended to fully appreciate the size, setting and potential of this exceptional property. \r\n\r\nNOTE: Retention planning is been applied for at present for the dwelling and we assume that a new septic tank may have to be installed. The property will be sold with full planning on grant of the retention and any works to be done for example the septic tank will be for the proposed purchase to complete at their cost. \r\nFull particulars & Viewing is strictly by appointment with the Sole Selling Agents."
      },
